WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.391
Baabiraawo maako, laamiiɗo, yiɗi ɓiɗɗo maako debbo mo'o warɗo, ngam maajum o hokki mo debbo.

00:00:07.471 --> 00:00:08.934
Saawre'en ɗon ɓuwa.

00:00:09.014 --> 00:00:17.704
Nde Yennenga hollitii ko o yiɗi, o jippini ngesa okka, o acci ɗum e koyɗe maako, bana suka maako ɓe acci mo.
